{"id":"7914c15bd7cca3e8","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-comb5-kappa-tree.md","title":"ZFC Comb5 Kappa Tree","display":"df-zfc-comb5-kappa-tree — ZFC Comb5 Kappa Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb5-kappa-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb5-kappa-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-comb5-kappa-tree — ZFC Comb5 Kappa Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]","[[58-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb5-kappa-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-kappa-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb5-kappa-tree — ZFC Comb5 Kappa Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"091259c83b563d39\" href=\"?note=091259c83b563d39\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(T,R,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S\\)</span> (exact tree-height predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"091259c83b563d39\" href=\"?note=091259c83b563d39\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}\">\\(\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}\\)</span> (node-level predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"091259c83b563d39\" href=\"?note=091259c83b563d39\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5KappaTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb5KappaTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land \\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;|\\{t\\in T\\mid\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\\}|&lt;\\kappa\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land \\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;|\\{t\\in T\\mid\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\\}|&lt;\\kappa\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-tree has height <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> and every level has cardinality below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\leq\\kappa\">\\(\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\)</span> is an ordinal/cardinal comparison rather than an accidental subset test.</li>\n<li>Tree height and node levels are inherited from the explicit predecessor-order isomorphism construction, rather than from unregistered <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ht}\">\\(\\operatorname{ht}\\)</span> operators.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md","status":"resolved","id":"091259c83b563d39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md","status":"resolved","id":"091259c83b563d39","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S$ (exact tree-height predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md","status":"resolved","id":"091259c83b563d39","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}$ (node-level predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T,R,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5KappaTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land \\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;|\\{t\\in T\\mid\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\\}|<\\kappa","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\leq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ht}","display":false}],"bytes":1495,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1657","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-comb5-kappa-tree.md|58-df-zfc-comb5-kappa-tree]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","091259c83b563d39","